{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>由江美儀再度領軍，夥拍張振朗、朱敏瀚、吳業坤及曾展望組成「試真D團隊」的節目《試真D唷》今次前往台灣進行深度探索。在第二集中，江美儀、張振朗及吳業坤前往高雄三民區，尋找極具性價比的平民美食。</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_389914fd20348137-2227\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>三人於當地品嚐了一款只需45元台幣（折合約港幣$11）的古早味豬油拌飯。這碗飯看似簡單，卻極具特色。天然提煉豬油將肥豬肉直接放入鍋中乾煎逼出油分製成豬油。除了淋上甘香的豬油外，更加入了醬油、炸蒜等香料，並在頂層打上一顆生蛋黃，吃前拌勻令口感極具層次。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_389914fd20348137-2227\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"effa9c6f-9a73-4b70-8160-a21841e38ca0.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026v7LSsGhf3S1789377750.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"effa9c6f-9a73-4b70-8160-a21841e38ca0.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"97aec52a-026c-4a04-b4f3-ed77bf591947.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026xRWXZtRdqa1789377750.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"97aec52a-026c-4a04-b4f3-ed77bf591947.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_389914fd20348137-2230\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>平日甚少接觸豬油拌飯的張振朗迎來了「第一次」的細味品嚐，他試食第一口後便讚不絕口。飯粒充滿濃厚油香，以豬油拌勻卻做到口感滑溜且毫不肥膩。由於江美儀點餐時特意要求「清淡一點」，令整體的鹹度拿捏得恰到好處，成功避開傳統豬油飯過鹹的問題。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_389914fd20348137-2230\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"33321fce-9206-464b-8ce9-b4d30225b94e.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026UjabI6HVT11789377750.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"33321fce-9206-464b-8ce9-b4d30225b94e.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_389914fd20348137-2230\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_389914fd20348137-2233\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>這碗售價約港幣$11的豬油拌飯真正做到價廉物美，最終更獲得高達 4.67 星（滿分5星）的極高評價，絕對值得納入必食清單中！</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T13:38:45.838874+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":401,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}